    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "# COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 — SUPPORTING / ON-DEMAND QC\n\nSTATUS = SUPPORTING QC LIBRARY / NOT ACTIVE UNIVERSAL HARD GATE\nACTIVE_PRODUCT_STREAM = #251 `DUNCAN PRIME MASTER — SINGLE PRODUCT STREAM R02`\nRESET_AUTHORITY = #251 comment `5506451195`\nUPSTREAM = #245 `FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02 = PASS`\n\n## PURPOSE\nPreserve the already-defined ZORR ivory-suit deformation rules as reusable production/QC controls without forcing six synthetic witness frames ahead of unrelated real production work.\n\nAuthority inputs remain:\n- accepted suit turnaround;\n- accepted costume/accessory sheet;\n- `BODY_CONSTRUCTION_R01`;\n- `HANDS_CANON_R03` / `HAND_EXPRESSION_R01`;\n- current ZORR fold law: force-localized folds, calm ivory planes, 2–5 meaningful fold shapes per large active region.\n\n## CONTROL LIBRARY\n1. `W01 ARM_RAISE` — shoulder seam / sleeve-cap / armhole / lapel-root / armpit-side-chest force.\n2. `W02 ELBOW_90` — sleeve compression/tension + cuff/watch.\n3. `W03 TORSO_TWIST` — lapel/chest/waist shear.\n4. `W04 SEATED_COMPRESSION` — jacket hem + trouser waist/crotch.\n5. `W05 KNEE_BEND` — trouser knee compression/tension.\n6. `W06 STRIDE_ANKLE` — trouser break + shoe/ankle relation.\n\nHard law remains: anime readability and large graphic garment planes outrank realistic cloth simulation. No decorative wrinkle noise. No hidden redesign.\n\n## ROLE CORRECTION R02\n`W01` is a high-information diagnostic control, not a mandatory film frame.\n\nThe six controls are applied when the actual production key drawing/pose contains the corresponding force, or when a real artifact exposes a concrete mechanics regression/uncertainty.\n\n`SIX_STANDALONE_SYNTHETIC_WITNESSES_BEFORE_UNRELATED_PRODUCT_WORK = NOT REQUIRED`\n\nThis does NOT waive mechanics quality. Any actual production artifact must pass every relevant control that applies to its pose.\n\n## EXISTING EVIDENCE\n- mechanics-definition/control matrix remains reusable;\n- previous W01 attempts remain historical FAIL evidence;\n- source/character pack sufficiency is closed unless fresh contradictory evidence proves regression;\n- Krita/source-bound direct edit is not a product acceptance criterion.\n\n## CURRENT STATE\n`COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01 = NOT TERMINAL PASS`\n`W01 = HISTORICAL FAILED DIAGNOSTIC / AVAILABLE FOR ON-DEMAND RETEST`\n\nNo PASS is being promoted by this role correction.\n\n## NEXT\nFollow #251 single product stream:\n`REAL PRODUCTION KEY DRAWING / SCENE-BOUND POSE -> APPLY RELEVANT #248 CONTROLS -> REPAIR ONLY FAILED LAYER -> CONTINUE PRODUCT ROUTE`.\n\nNo character redesign. No source recovery from zero. No new framework/editor/runner. Image generation/editing still requires the applicable OWNER authority.",
